{"id":"68e2d5e250a907ad","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-church-turing.md","title":"Church-Turing Thesis","display":"thm-church-turing — Church-Turing Thesis","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-church-turing","aliases":["57-thm-church-turing"],"display":"thm-church-turing — Church-Turing Thesis","depends_on":["[[57-df-effective-procedure]]","[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]","[[57-df-turing-machine]]","[[57-df-encoding]]","[[57-df-recursive-function]]","[[57-df-composition-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-church-turing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-church-turing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-church-turing — Church-Turing Thesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3921429aff327c8\" href=\"?note=f3921429aff327c8\" title=\"57-df-effective-procedure\">57-df-effective-procedure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" href=\"?note=4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function-class\">57-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"446d13f76de9da28\" href=\"?note=446d13f76de9da28\" title=\"57-df-normal-form-theorem\">57-df-normal-form-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal P_k\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal P_k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_k\">\\(D_k\\)</span>、数值元组及打包映射取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>。输入和输出使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a> 的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{Word}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{Word}_k\\)</span> 表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}\">\\(\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f3921429aff327c8\" href=\"?note=f3921429aff327c8\" title=\"57-df-effective-procedure\">57-df-effective-procedure</a> 的机器谓词，底层机器取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a>。本环境固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=D_k,Y=\\mathbb N,\\iota_X=\\operatorname{in}_k,\\iota_Y=\\operatorname{out}\">\\(X=D_k,Y=\\mathbb N,\\iota_X=\\operatorname{in}_k,\\iota_Y=\\operatorname{out}\\)</span>。正规形对应取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"446d13f76de9da28\" href=\"?note=446d13f76de9da28\" title=\"57-df-normal-form-theorem\">57-df-normal-form-theorem</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{in}_k:D_k\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad\\operatorname{in}_k(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Word}_k(\\vec x)=\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\operatorname{unpack}_k(\\vec x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{in}_k:D_k\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad\\operatorname{in}_k(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Word}_k(\\vec x)=\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\operatorname{unpack}_k(\\vec x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad\\operatorname{out}(y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{out}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad\\operatorname{out}(y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\operatorname{in}_k,\\operatorname{out}}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\operatorname{in}_k,\\operatorname{out}}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(f),\\qquad\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Effective}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(f),\\qquad\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正文仅陈述已经形式定义的机器模型与部分递归函数的等价性。历史上的 Church–Turing 论题涉及非形式的“有效过程”，不能靠同名谓词把该经验论题变成已证明的数学定理。文件名与调用名不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-effective-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"f3921429aff327c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-effective-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"4bf1a2a7d352c15e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-normal-form-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"446d13f76de9da28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"3cca93ccf127333f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[5